From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 22:46:58 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(tests): isolate shape-mask diagnostic output

Reserve a unique directory under Cargo's compile-time test temporary root.
Avoid shared OS temporary paths and preserve other test runs' output.
Pin scratch and default-directory independence.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #2127
